{UTF-8}
Rookies= INTEG (
	Hiring-Assimilation-Rookie Quits,
		40)
	~	People
	~	A two-stage workforce: hiring closes the gap to the desired workforce, rookies become experts (written for SD Lab).
	|
Experts= INTEG (
	Assimilation-Expert Quits,
		160)
	~	People
	~	
	|
Hiring=
	MAX(0, (Desired Workforce-Rookies-Experts)/Hiring Time)
	~	People/Week
	~	No firing: a workforce above target shrinks by quits only.
	|
Assimilation=
	Rookies/Assimilation Time
	~	People/Week
	~	
	|
Rookie Quits=
	Rookies/Rookie Tenure
	~	People/Week
	~	
	|
Expert Quits=
	Experts/Expert Tenure
	~	People/Week
	~	
	|
Desired Workforce=
	200+100*PULSE TRAIN(25, 100, 200, 1e+09)
	~	People
	~	Announced plans: 200, and 300 for 100 weeks in every 200.
	|
Hiring Time=
	6
	~	Week
	~	
	|
Assimilation Time=
	20
	~	Week
	~	
	|
Rookie Tenure=
	40
	~	Week
	~	
	|
Expert Tenure=
	80
	~	Week
	~	
	|
